13363      proc causalmed data=sashelp.birthwgt decomp;
13364      class LowBirthWgt Smoking Death AgeGroup Married Race
13365      Drinking SomeCollege /descending;
13366      mediator LowBirthWgt = Smoking;
13367      model Death = LowBirthWgt | Smoking;
13368      covar AgeGroup Married Race Drinking SomeCollege;
13369      evaluate 'Low Birth-Weight' LowBirthWgt='Yes' / nodecomp;
13370      evaluate 'Normal Birth-Weight' LowBirthWgt='No' / nodecomp;
13371      run;

NOTE: PROC CAUSALMED is modeling the probability that Death='Yes' in the outcome model.
NOTE: PROC CAUSALMED is modeling the probability that LowBirthWgt='Yes' in the mediator model.
NOTE: The PROCEDURE CAUSALMED printed pages 1822-1827.

